-playing-the-cosigner-for-nscales-ai-data-center-in-west-virginia/"},{"attribution":{"canonical":"https://aihot.news/items/akdeq33m7cpr8m7zsfgvfiz5c","source":"AIHOT"},"category":"ai-products","id":"akdeq33m7cpr8m7zsfgvfiz5c","permalink":"https://aihot.news/items/akdeq33m7cpr8m7zsfgvfiz5c","published_at":"2026-10-31T00:58:00Z","ref":"A4","score":65,"selected":true,"source":"Figma AI / Agent / Make","summary":"Figma 宣布 Figma Weave，一个面向持续产出需求的创意团队平台，并把 Weave 创作工作流与 Figma 画框连接起来。Weave 用连接的节点承载图像和视频的生成与编辑，支持分支探索、多模型对比、色彩校正、合成、裁剪、Painter 等编辑节点；工作流可打包成 Weave tool 让团队成员一键运行，社区工具发布已上线。","title":"Figma 发布 Weave 创作平台，用节点化工作流让创意流程可复用","title_en":"The TL;DR on Figma Weave: Make your creative process repeatable","url":"https://www.figma.com/blog/the-tldr-on-figma-weave/"},{"attribution":{"canonical":"https://aihot.news/items/cbggw7imkzd4c01ifblroln6v","source":"AIHOT"},"category":"industry","id":"cbggw7imkzd4c01ifblroln6v","permalink":"https://aihot.news/items/cbggw7imkzd4c01ifblroln6v","published_at":"2026-10-31T00:03:47Z","ref":"A5","score":82,"selected":true,"source":"公众号：千问APP（阿里）","summary":"10月31日阿里巴巴宣布与Apple合作，将千问集成至Apple智能，中国用户可在Siri、写作工具及视觉智能中调用千问的文本与图像理解、内容生成能力。功能11月4日起随iOS开发者Beta开放测试，12月iOS 27.3正式发布时推出；用户可自主选择开通，请求与回复不用于模型训练。","title":"阿里巴巴与Apple合作，千问集成至Apple智能，11月4日开放测试","title_en":"阿里巴巴与Apple达成合作，将千问集成至Apple智能","url":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzYzNDE5MDEwMQ%3D%3D&mid=2247489416&idx=1&sn=9525f61df8086fcd6fe4d4183da068de"},{"attribution":{"canonical":"https://aihot.news/items/upl3hjjdokqe13w3ieo9opr0v","source":"AIHOT"},"category":"tip","id":"upl3hjjdokqe13w3ieo9opr0v","permalink":"https://aihot.news/items/upl3hjjdokqe13w3ieo9opr0v","published_at":"2026-10-31T00:00:00Z","ref":"A6","score":70,"selected":true,"source":"OpenRouter：Announcements（RSS）","summary":"OpenRouter 发布教程，演示用 @openrouter/agent 0.11.0 在 TypeScript 中搭建定时运行的常驻 AI Agent，监控 Hacker News 并生成摘要。","title":"OpenRouter 教程：用 Agent SDK 搭建常驻 AI Agent 监控 Hacker News","title_en":"How to Build Your Own Alway